rooms_desc ({"Welcome to Westley's Place!  It may not be much, but Westley calls it home.On the walls you can see pictures of his beloved Glyn, along with a goldenplaque that catches your attention.  in the middle of the room is a smallcarousel, but don't try to ride it, it hasn't worked in years.  You cansee a booth alongside the western wall, covered with pictures and othermementos that are scattered about.  In the northern corner you can see a smallstatue of Westley, made for him by the sculptor of the Corellians.  If you're lucky you might even get to see Westley throwing darts at the boardnailed on the south wall.  To the north you can see Westley's cove.","You have entered Westley's cove.  The fireplace crackles quietly against the sounds of Mozart echoing through the room.  In the corner you can seehis metal cot, along with his nightstand covered with pictures of his beloved Glyn.  He hasn't had much opportunity to decorate the room much,but he's tried as best he can.  On the walls are trophies and mementos he'searned from his travels.  You shiver at how hauntingly quiet this room seemsto be.  To the south you see his foyer.","There's really nothing here to see, save for the lounge chair in the corneralong with a window with the view of the ocean, even if it is one of hisillusions.  You might even catch Westley here once in a while just lettinghis mind go wherever it wants to.","This room seems rather simplistic compared to the other rooms, but it's only ahallway so there isn't much else that could fit in here.  There is a smalltable against the wall with a vase on it, but other than that this room isbare to the bone.","It's a bathroom, get over it.  There's nothing here to see.","This is Westley's little greenhouse, just a little addition to his house thathe felt he had to superfluously spend money on, just to have it here.  Youcan see all the little plants he's grown in here in the very short time he'shad the greenhouse.  There are some very unusual scents in here, but youcan't quite put your finger on it.","This is where Westley barbecues his steaks just in case he's in the mood.You look up and notice that there's no roof to this room except for a metalscreen.  In the middle of the room is a huge stone fireplace where Westleydoes all of his cooking, or most of it.","Ever been to Atlantic City?  Maybe even Las Vegas?  This room makes them alllook tiny.  Even though it's confined to a simple little room, it has allthe makings of a big casino.  You can see the gambling tables all around theroom, unfortunately the gamblers have all left for greener pastures.  GuessWestley shouldn't have fixed all the games.  There are blackjack tables,poker tables, roulette tables, even a window for virtual horse racing.  Ofcourse, this room shouldn't even be here, but no one ever accused Westley ofbeing the traditional one.","This is Westley's storage room, where he puts anything ranging from food toweapons to even teddy bears for target practice.  It even has an exit to theshop just so he can get there a lot easier than running all the way back tohis foyer to get the hell out of his house.  Other than that there's nothingto look at, except for a few weapons lying on the floor.","This is Westley's favorite room out of his entire house.He's put a lot more effort into this room than into the other rooms he's createdfor himself.  Running around the room are his greatest and favorite creationsthrough his years, the Warner Brothers and their sister Dot.  You can seeYakko Warner running around the room after a nurse in a skimpy white outfit,while his brother Wakko waits by the door for something, anything to eat.Meanwhile, their sister Dot just wants a little peace and quiet.  Westley justwishes he were a wiz to actually code Yakko, Wakko and Dot and not just havethem as mere illusions.  Then again, there are always those copyrightinfringement things that always manage to tangle things up.  C'est la vie.",})
rooms_short ({"Westley's foyer and welcoming room","Westley's cove","Westley's rest & relaxation room","Simple hallway","Westley's bathroom","Westley's greenhouse","Westley's barbecue pit","Westley's gambling parlor","Westley's pantry and storage room","Westley's toy room",})
